<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN IN ASIA CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN IN ASIA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka defeated Pakistan by 15 runs in their Asia Cup match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 239 all out in 49.5 overs; Pakistan 224-9 innings closed.</p>
</text>
